/.lake/
*.olean

# --- third-party papers -----------------------------------------------------
# This repository is public, so it does not redistribute papers by other authors.
# Local copies live under the relevant audits/*/sources/ directory and are kept
# out of git; each such directory carries a SOURCES.md with the DOI or arXiv
# identifier and the retrieval URL, and `pdftotext -layout` reproduces the text
# extractions that the reports cite by line number.
#
# Repo-wide, so a new audit folder is covered from the moment it is created --
# this rule exists because a per-directory .gitignore that had not yet been
# committed failed to protect a branch cut from main (see PR #10).
**/sources/*.pdf
**/sources/*.txt

# ...except the author's own technical notes, which ARE tracked.
!audits/sturmian_irrationality/sources/A_*.pdf
!audits/sturmian_irrationality/sources/B_*.pdf
